2026-03-29 22:25:51 [gemini-3.1-pro] 
2026-03-29 22:25:51 [gemini-3.1-pro] The TV power cycle test is an excellent way to check sync stability. The recovery delay or rolling
2026-03-29 22:25:51 [gemini-3.1-pro] you might be seeing is very common at this stage. It usually points to the vertical blanking
2026-03-29 22:25:51 [gemini-3.1-pro] interval; standard PAL TVs expect specific pre-equalizing, serration, and post-equalizing pulses
2026-03-29 22:25:51 [gemini-3.1-pro] during vblank to keep their phase-locked loops synchronized.
2026-03-29 22:25:51 [gemini-3.1-pro] 
