2026-03-29 22:25:51 [gemini-3.1-pro] hand-in-hand, as true PAL interlace relies heavily on those half-line timings and equalizing pulses
2026-03-29 22:25:51 [gemini-3.1-pro] to differentiate between the odd and even fields.
2026-03-29 22:25:51 [gemini-3.1-pro] 
