2026-03-30 19:25:36 [deepseek-chat] - Uses PIO state machine for precise timing (150MHz clock)
2026-03-30 19:25:36 [deepseek-chat] - Frame buffer organized as 32-bit words with `plot()`/`unplot()` functions
