2026-03-30 22:19:50 [gemini-3.1-pro] `plainHistory`, `anthropicMessages`, and `prepareGeminiPrompt`, ensure those mappers correctly pass
2026-03-30 22:19:50 [gemini-3.1-pro] through `role: "tool"` and `role: "assistant"` with `tool_calls`. Your `plainHistory` and Gemini
