2026-04-01 20:09:00 [gemini-3.1-lite] grow very large, this may become inefficient (O(N*M)). If performance becomes a concern, you could
2026-04-01 20:09:00 [gemini-3.1-lite] refactor it using a `Set` for O(N+M) complexity:
